## Boundary

This adapter owns project-local routes, packet paths, workflow adapters, and
permission boundaries. It does not contain the global CoAgent core and does not
grant project authority to reusable tools by itself.

Project facts, task state, evidence, and acceptance decisions remain under this
project directory unless the user approves a named infrastructure action.

